@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:今天奔波了一整天，又遇上刚刚的闹剧，<br>艾玛她们积累了不少疲劳。回到地下后，她们几个累得脚都软了。|#0101Adv21_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的牢房最靠前，<br>她最先回到自己的房间里。|#0101Adv21_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……明天肌肉要痛一整天了……|#0101Adv21_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:累死了，光冲澡已经缓解不了疲劳了，好想泡个澡啊。<br>呼啊～|#0101Adv21_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜打了个哈欠，<br>眼神都有些朦胧了。|#0101Adv21_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR13,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也跟着打了个哈欠，<br>迷迷糊糊走在过道上。|#0101Adv21_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，她走到了自己的房门前，<br>正准备回房。|#0101Adv21_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时——|#0101Adv21_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 27：どんっと人がぶつかる音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_27 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@SpawnExtended Path:ShakeBackground

[PrintTextModified Text:哇！|#0101Adv21_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有个人撞到了艾玛，<br>害艾玛一屁股跌坐在地上。|#0101Adv21_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两眼昏花的艾玛抬头定睛一看，<br>站在面前的是亚里沙。|#0101Adv21_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……又是你。<br>走路能不能不要做白日梦啊！|#0101Adv21_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:对、对不起。|#0101Adv21_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的道歉，亚里沙又咂了咂舌，<br>然后走掉了。|#0101Adv21_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:明明是她自己撞上来的，真是没礼貌！|#0101Adv21_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你没事吧，艾玛小姐。有没有受伤？|#0101Adv21_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，完全没事！嘿咻！|#0101Adv21_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛快速站起身来，<br>动手拍落身上的灰尘。|#0101Adv21_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:——你们没事吧？|#0101Adv21_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知什么时候，蕾雅也来到了她们的身边。<br>所有人的视线集中在蕾雅身上。|#0101Adv21_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:本、<br>本小姐可用不着你来关心！|#0101Adv21_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:……我做了什么害你讨厌的事情吗？<br>真头疼，我可是想和大家友好相处的。|#0101Adv21_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:对了，我等一下准备直播。<br>你们愿意的话，希望你们也能看一下。|#0101Adv21_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:哼，真是辛苦你每天费心照顾其他人呢。|#0101Adv21_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然辛苦是辛苦了点啦，哈哈，性格使然而已。|#0101Adv21_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对露出为难笑容的蕾雅，<br>汉娜涨红了脸。|#0101Adv21_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（蕾雅她果然是<br>　魅惑人心的魔法师……）|#0101Adv21_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:今天的直播是可可和米莉亚邀我的。|#0101Adv21_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想今天这场应该会比较热闹和开心。<br>如果能在这个令人郁闷的地方里给大家带来一些消遣，<br>我就满足了。|#0101Adv21_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:哼～倒也不是不能看一眼哦？<br>走、走啦，梅露露！|#0101Adv21_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯……|#0101Adv21_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜抓住梅露露的手腕，<br>逃也似的跑回了自己的房里。|#0101Adv21_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只剩艾玛一人留在了原地，<br>和蕾雅四目相对。|#0101Adv21_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了。今天我去医务室的时候，<br>不小心错拿了安安的手机。|#0101Adv21_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅从口袋里摸出了一部手机。|#0101Adv21_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我等一下有直播要开……<br>真是不好意思，希望你可以帮我还给她。|#0101Adv21_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，这么点小事没关系的。|#0101Adv21_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我想说，<br>我觉得蕾雅你在做的事情真的很棒！|#0101Adv21_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我们意见不太一样……不过，<br>我希望我们可以互相帮助。|#0101Adv21_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅有些惊讶地瞪大了眼睛。<br>不过很快，她便露出了一个温柔的微笑。|#0101Adv21_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你。|#0101Adv21_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛从蕾雅手里拿过手机，<br>急匆匆前往了医务室。|#0101Adv21_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

